1. ENGLISH SUBTITLE FILES (Episodes 01–40 .SRT & Season Archive)
================================================================================
Scope:
All 40 English subtitle files located in `subtitles/`
(`BlazingTeens_2006_S01E01.srt` through `BlazingTeens_2006_S01E40.srt`),
`subtitles/BlazingTeens_2006_SRTs.zip`, and the corresponding release archives.

Originality & Authorship:
All English translations, dialogue adaptations, and subtitle timing
synchronizations in these 40 files were created independently from scratch by
Mukarram Nazir directly from the original Mandarin-language episodes, without
copying or adapting any third-party dub, broadcast script, or external subtitle
source.

